    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: ContractItemPrice records with both EffectiveStartDate and EffectiveEndDate null.
Why it matters: Without dates, the contracted pricing may persist indefinitely (locking in old prices forever) or never engage (customer doesn&apos;t get the negotiated rate). Either way the customer experience doesn&apos;t match the contract.
Suppress a finding: for genuinely indefinite contractual arrangements.
Disable the detector: leave on.</value></values>
